      citation: "Unzue L, Romero-Castro MJ, Garc\xEDa E, et al. Successful percutaneous treatment of occlusive spontaneous coronary artery dissection with a 'pull-back injection technique': case report. Eur Heart J Case Rep. 2021;5(6):ytab165. doi:10.1093/ehjcr/ytab165",
      url: "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8274651/"
