    presentation: "73-year-old man with 6 months of progressive exertional breathlessness and mild chest pain. Hypertension, dyslipidaemia, type 2 diabetes, cerebrovascular disease, CKD stage 3b and Parkinson's disease. Grade III/VI ejection systolic murmur.",
